    <bpmn:process id="W_W3492" name="W3492. Remodel Customer Experience &amp; Feedback Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Post re-opening (W3489); feedback cycle
Frequency: Post re-opening + periodic
Volume: All remodeled stores
Owner: Customer Experience / Insights
Participants: CX (links to VS-13), Consumer Insights (links to VS-44), Store Manager (links to VS-07), Marketing (links to VS-14), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3492 — Remodel Customer Experience &amp; Feedback Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3492_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3492_Lane1" name="CX">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3492_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3492_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3492_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3492_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3492_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3492_Start3" name="Post re-opening (W3489); feedback cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3492_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3492_Task4" name="CX/Insights capture post-remodel customer feedback: NPS/CSAT (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CX/Insights capture post-remodel customer feedback: NPS/CSAT (links to VS-13/VS-44.1), store-visit surveys, mystery shopping (links to VS-55.2/VS-44), social/reviews, and trade-account feedback (links to VS-43); compare to pre-remodel baseline and peer stores
Responsible (R): CX / Insights
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Post re-opening</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3492_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3492_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3492_Task5" name="CX/Store Manager assess the experience: layout/wayfinding ease, department…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CX/Store Manager assess the experience: layout/wayfinding ease, department findability, checkout speed (links to VS-08), service quality, ambiance/lighting, and cleanliness; identify strengths and friction points
Responsible (R): CX / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Post re-opening</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3492_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3492_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3492_Task6" name="CX/Insights feed findings to the store (corrective) and to the program review…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CX/Insights feed findings to the store (corrective) and to the program review (W3496/format innovation W3495): replicate successful design choices, fix recurring friction in the next concept, and report CX impact vs the business case (W3476)
Responsible (R): CX / Insights
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Post re-opening</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3492_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
