        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/Project Manager close the project financially: final cost vs budget (links to VS-40/W1825), commitment/PO closure, retention release (W3482), CIP-to-asset turnover (links to VS-40/W1828/W3560), and capex-portfolio reconciliation (links to VS-112/W3564)
Responsible (R): Finance / Project Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
