        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Project Manager conduct the post-implementation review (PIR): scope delivered vs planned, schedule variance, cost variance and drivers (change orders W3556, scope, market), quality/snag closure (W3488), HSE record (links to VS-24), and contractor performance (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / PMO
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
